                      "value": "Inputs \ncodeOfficerList = {{$context.$nodes.GET_CODE_OFFICERS.$output.items}}\n\nMaxInsCount = {{$context.$variables.MaxInsCount}}\n\nInstructions\n\nTask:\n1. Group all rows by PersonId.\n2. For each PersonId, aggregate InspectionCount across all rows for that PersonId.\n3. Use the aggregated InspectionCount for eligibility.\n4. Select only officers where aggregated InspectionCount < MaxInsCount.\n5. If multiple officers qualify, choose the one with the lowest aggregated InspectionCount.\n6.If no officers qualify or if codeOfficerList=[], return output result as null\n7. Return only valid JSON or null."
                    }
